[{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0330","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0330.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-20585","title":"AMD IOMMU 写缓冲区漏洞","description":"AMD IOMMU（输入输出内存管理单元）在主机缓冲区访问过程中对逆向映射表（RMP）的检查不足，已具备权限的攻击者配合被入侵的虚拟机监视器（hypervisor）可触发越界内存访问条件，绕过 RMP 安全校验，导致机密虚拟机数据完整性遭到破坏。该漏洞影响 AMD 多款处理器平台，CVSS 评分 5.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.6,"aliases":["CVE-2023-20585"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2026-04-16T19:16:31Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:30:22Z","remediation":"建议将 AMD EPYC 7003 系列处理器 SEV 固件升级至 1.37.23 及以上版本（或更新 Milan PI_1.0.0.H 及以上版本 BIOS），EPYC 9004/8004 系列升级至 SEV FW 1.37.31 及以上版本（或更新 GenoaPI_1.0.0.G 及以上版本 BIOS）。此漏洞修复需同步配合操作系统厂商提供的 SEV-SNP 安全补丁，且修复后须关闭并重新初始化 SNP 客户机以使缓解措施生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.amd.com/en/resources/product-security/bulletin/AMD-SB-3016.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2023/20xxx/CVE-2023-20585.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2023/20xxx/CVE-2023-20585.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/279a154c402a1296d98ff80144b86a72bd57bdc2/content/posts/cve-2023-20585.md","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-20585","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-20585.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2026/04/GHSA-c43c-pr38-m5g2/GHSA-c43c-pr38-m5g2.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-20585","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2023/CVE-2023-20585.json","https://github.com/mthcht/ThreatIntel-Reports/blob/f2820d9a533a5111de0cb49dfddeac0dacf6dffb/Intel%20Reports/thehackernews_com/2026_04_microsoft-issues-patches-for-sharepoint_html/content.txt","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2023-20585"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0330.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0412","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0412.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-54207","title":"Linux Kernel HID uclogic 驱动释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 HID 子系统 uclogic 驱动中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。该漏洞源于驱动在执行 devm 分配 input_dev 名称时错误地引用了 input 设备而非 HID 设备，当 input_dev 被注销并触发依赖该名称的 uevent 事件时，名称已被 devres 管理机制提前释放。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成系统崩溃或实现权限提升。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-54207"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-30T13:16:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:47:00Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 5.10.249、5.15.199、6.1.53、6.4.16 或 6.5.3 及以上版本（各长期支持分支对应修复版本）。如无法升级内核，可应用补丁 commit f78bb490b16ec 等 6 个稳定分支修复提交，或通过发行版安全更新渠道安装补丁。该漏洞需本地低权限访问触发，可通过限制本地用户登录和启用 SELinux/AppArmor 缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4c2707dfee5847dc0b5ecfbe512c29c93832fdc4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/51f49e3927ad545cec0c0afb86856ccacd9f085d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/58f0d1c0e494a88f301bf455da7df4366f179bbb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dd613a4e45f8d35f49a63a2064e5308fa5619e29","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f283805d984343b2f216e2f4c6c7af265b9542ae","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f78bb490b16ecb506d4904be4b00bf9aad6588f9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2023/54xxx/CVE-2023-54207.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/54xxx/CVE-2023-54207.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-54207","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-