json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-54082.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2023-54082","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/12/GHSA-ggff-5vp9-rcr3/GHSA-ggff-5vp9-rcr3.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2023-54082.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-54082.json","https://github.com/devanyops/cvechecker/blob/33908273064056e6531c4827b9ca09062ac8ac19/qacves/notaffect.20260104","https://github.com/apmatlock/apmatlock.github.io/blob/cc2c70bee4acb769e6d3b2c8fb2b8797181dfd23/cybersecnews/2025-12-25.html","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/64de4f2cd86a1126b3a6d15ba07e17a7857c3906/CVE-2023/CVE-2023-540xx/CVE-2023-54082.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0410.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0411","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0411.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-54161","title":"Linux Kernel af_unix 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AF_UNIX 套接字实现中的 unix_stream_sendpage() 函数存在空指针解引用漏洞。当对端文件描述符在套接字间循环传递时，垃圾回收机制在未加锁情况下释放 skb，而 unix_stream_sendpage() 同时无锁访问对端接收队列尾部的 skb，导致 use-after-free 和空指针解引用。本地攻击者可通过特制系统调用触发此竞态条件，导致内核崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 6.5 以下所有包含 unix_stream_sendpage 的内核版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-54161"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-12-24T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-12-29T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至包含补丁 d39fc9b94dc0 的稳定版本（如 6.1.46+），或直接升级至 6.5 及以上版本（6.5+ 因 sendpage 重构已天然免疫此漏洞）。Debian/Ubuntu 运行 apt update && apt upgrade linux-image 后重启；RHEL/CentOS 运行 yum update kernel 后重启。如无法立即升级，可通过 seccomp 策略拦截 sendfile 系统调用中涉及 AF_UNIX 套接字的路径作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2023/54xxx/CVE-2023-54161.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-54161.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-54161.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2023-54161","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/12/GHSA-7j7j-rcvh-xpm2/GHSA-7j7j-rcvh-xpm2.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2023-54161.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-54161.json","https://github.com/devanyops/cvechecker/blob/33908273064056e6531c4827b9ca09062ac8ac19/qacves/notaffect.20260104","https://github.com/apmatlock/apmatlock.github.io/blob/cc2c70bee4acb769e6d3b2c8fb2b8797181dfd23/cybersecnews/2025-12-25.html","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/64de4f2cd86a1126b3a6d15ba07e17a7857c3906/CVE-2023/CVE-2023-541xx/CVE-2023-54161.json","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d39fc9b94dc0719afa4bc8e58341a5eb41febef3","https://github.com/torvalds/linux/commit/d39fc9b94dc0719afa4bc8e58341a5eb41febef3"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0411.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0409","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-54061","title":"Linux Kernel x86 clear_user_rep_good 异常处理注释缺陷导致内核崩溃","description":"Linux 内核 x86 架构的 clear_user_rep_good() 函数中，异常处理表的注释位置错误：rep movsb 指令的异常表条目指向了其之前的寄存器移动指令而非实际用户空间访问指令。当用户空间访问触发异常时，异常处理程序无法在异常表中找到对应指令，导致内核无法正确返回 -EFAULT 错误码，而是触发内核 oops 崩溃。该问题影响使用 rep stosb/movsb 进行用户空间内存清零操作的场景，如 ext4 文件系统的 DIO 读取路径。该 CVE 已被撤销，因为相关代码已从主线内核中移除。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-54061"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-12-24T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-12-29T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该 CVE 已被撤销，相关代码已从主线内核中移除（commit d2c95f9d6802）。如需修复，可合入补丁 commit b805d212c394f291f116b12c53401e7ba0c4d408，或升级至包含该补丁的内核版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b805d212c394f291f116b12c53401e7ba0c4d408","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-54061","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2023/54xxx/CVE-2023-54061.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0408","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53749","title":"Linux Kernel x86 clear_user_rep_good 异常处理注释缺陷","description":"CVE-2023-53749 已被 CVE 编号管理机构（CNA）撤销/拒绝，原提交涉及 Linux 内核 x86 架构中 clear_user_rep_good() 函数异常处理注释的修正，经评估后该问题不属于安全漏洞范畴，故该 CVE 编号被废弃。由于该 CVE 并非有效漏洞，不具有漏洞原理、影响范围、攻击条件及利用方式等相关信息，开发者无需对此采取任何安全措施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53749"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-08T02:15:50Z","updated":"2025-12-29T15:15:51Z","remediation":"该漏洞已在 Linux 主线内核提交 d2c95f9d6802 中移除存在问题的 clear_user_rep_good() 代码路径，并在稳定分支提交 90510aed20a26e1a4dede4ef6b640e6a4122f38f 中修复了异常表注释位置。建议升级内核至包含上述补丁的版本（如 6.x 主线或对应 LTS 稳定版），确保用户空间内存访问异常时正确返回 -EFAULT 而非触发内核崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53749.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2023-53749","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c30cb75c630bd0892c286bac41dd51c65d6a6546/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53749.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53749.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/12/GHSA-g2f7-m38p-frw3/GHSA-g2f7-m38p-frw3.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2023-53749","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/64de4f2cd86a1126b3a6d15ba07e17a7857c3906/CVE-2023/CVE-2023-537xx/CVE-2023-53749.json","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/87dd30aa48db35ba8d8b4a33772213f42a64ff82/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2025-12-10_09-31-46.md","https://github.com/SecurityTapestry-Queen/nvd-cve-api-search/blob/8eb3e38c30216528c94a135e9298cebd51d3c6bf/archive/2025-12-10/report-12-10-2025-20-10-43.csv","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/2f3c8464ecb7e7fdc3b1076605ef127bac54ce3e/advisories/2025/12/EUVD-2023-60079.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0406","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53642","title":"Linux Kernel x86 clear_user_rep_good() 异常处理标注缺陷导致内核崩溃漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 x86 架构 clear_user_rep_good() 函数存在异常处理注释位置错误漏洞。该函数将异常表条目指向寄存器移动指令而非实际的用户空间内存访问指令 `rep movsb`，导致用户空间访问触发异常时，异常处理程序无法在异常表中定位到对应条目，系统无法正常返回 -EFAULT，转而触发内核崩溃（kernel oops），可被本地攻击者利用构造拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 x86 架构多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53642"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-07T16:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:46Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含 commit d2c95f9d6802 的版本（如 6.2+），或至少 cherry-pick 该提交及依赖的 e046fe5a36a9。对于无法升级内核的生产环境，可临时限制未授权用户对 ext4 等文件系统的预读操作（preadv2）以降低触发概率，但根本修复仍需内核补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/76ce32682635fe907e0f8e64e039e773e5c7508f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/90510aed20a26e1a4dede4ef6b640e6a4122f38f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b805d212c394f291f116b12c53401e7ba0c4d408","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e046fe5a36a970bc14fbfbcb2074a48776f6b671","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53642.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53642.yaml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53642.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2023-53642","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53642.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53642.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-h9cf-c7q8-gcqh/GHSA-h9cf-c7q8-gcqh.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2023-53642","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a27a686a264fc4e9bcba17d70b8a547ed5ec5305/2023/CVE-2023-53642.json","https://github.com/SecurityTapestry-Queen/nvd-cve-api-search/blob/8eb3e38c30216528c94a135e9298cebd51d3c6bf/archive/2025-12-29/report-12-29-2025-20-13-14.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0405","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0405.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53543","title":"Linux 内核 vdpa 越界读取漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 vdpa 子系统的 vdpa_nl_policy 结构体缺少对最大 VQP 属性的 nlattr 长度校验，本地攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 nlmsg 消息触发越界读取漏洞（CWE-787）。该漏洞类似于 CVE-2023-3773，可导致敏感内存信息泄露或权限提升。影响使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。建议升级至包含该补丁的内核版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53543"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-04T16:15:49Z","updated":"2026-06-18T14:29:50Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至以下安全版本：5.15.x 系列升级至 5.15.209 及以上，6.1.x 系列升级至 6.1.47 及以上，6.4.x 系列升级至 6.4.12 及以上，其他版本升级至 6.5 及以上。补丁提交为 baed19c108ac 等。如无法立即升级，可通过黑名单禁用 vDPA 内核模块（echo \"blacklist vdpa\" >> /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist.conf）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5d6ba607d6cb5c58a4ddf33381e18c83dbb4098f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/baed19c108ac8287425b93a44985bbe9a0b1af8d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ea65e8b5e6b1a34deda7564f09c90e9e80db436a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ff71709445ac033e6e250d971683110e4781c068","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53543.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53543.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53543","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-53543.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53543.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53543.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53543.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/