a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2023-53469","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-8r69-gc7h-5h9c/GHSA-8r69-gc7h-5h9c.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0c249a3a9e33f6be108f20b1748383e3cab3e489/2023/CVE-2023-53469.json","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/2f3c8464ecb7e7fdc3b1076605ef127bac54ce3e/advisories/2025/10/EUVD-2025-32818.json","https://github.com/Idanconley123/advisoryDataPipeline/blob/0a0c8ef966a818418dd2d14cc089f1522ac254f3/advisory_not_applicable.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0404.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0403","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0403.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53466","title":"Linux 内核 mt7915 WiFi 驱动内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核中 MediaTek MT7915 WiFi 驱动（mt76）的 `mt7915_mcu_exit` 函数存在内存泄漏漏洞。当 `mt7915_firmware_state` 执行失败时，MCU SKB 队列未及时清理，导致已分配内存无法释放。本地攻击者可反复触发固件状态检测失败，耗尽系统内存资源，最终导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 mt76 驱动的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53466"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-01T12:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:24Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.64+、6.6.3+ 或 6.7+ 版本，其中已合入修复提交 9aa9d1f2c6（修复 mt7915_mcu_exit 中 skb 队列未清理导致的内存泄漏）。如无法升级内核，可卸载 mt7915 驱动模块（modprobe -r mt7915e）禁用受影响硬件，或通过内核 livepatch 机制应用热补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3095fe1e1d3198e62a3c7116c4cf7c734871475f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/49bd78282e79ad177d14f37f4049f0605bf92dad","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4cbb876153b63fe248200f734069c6881cf97722","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53466.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53466.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53466","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53466.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53466.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53466.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-p6xh-5j4q-m59x/GHSA-p6xh-5j4q-m59x.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2023-53466","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2023/CVE-2023-53466.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2023-53466"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0403.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0402","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0402.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53460","title":"Linux Kernel rtw88 驱动 usb probe 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 rtw88 Realtek 无线网卡驱动的 USB 探测函数 rtw_usb_probe() 中存在内存泄漏漏洞。当在驱动初始化的特定路径触发错误时，ieee80211_alloc_hw() 分配的 hw 对象未能通过 goto 语句跳转至释放逻辑，导致内核内存泄漏。本地攻击者可通过插入特制 USB 设备触发该错误处理路径，反复利用可耗尽系统内存导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 Realtek rtw88 驱动的 Linux 系统，开发者已通过在错误路径中引入 goto 语句确保资源释放来修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53460"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-01T12:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:23Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.3.4 或更高版本，该版本已合入修复提交 6cc92379b80a。如无法升级内核，可手动 cherry-pick 补丁提交 48181d285623 或 6cc92379b80a 至当前内核源码并重新编译 rtw88 模块。临时缓解措施可卸载 rtw88 内核模块（rmmod rtw88_usb）并禁用 Realtek USB 无线网卡的使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/48181d285623198c33bb9698992502687b258efa","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6cc92379b80af005e1f49ef6ef790cddc58cf0da","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53460.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53460.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53460","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53460.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53460.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53460.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53460","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2023/CVE-2023-53460.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2023-53460","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-qhcv-7g4x-gf9r/GHSA-qhcv-7g4x-gf9r.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0402.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0401","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0401.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53447","title":"Linux Kernel f2fs 竞争条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 F2FS 文件系统在 f2fs_remount() 函数中存在条件竞争漏洞。当系统以读写方式重新挂载 F2FS 文件系统时，default_options() 会先将挂载选项重置为默认值，随后 parse_options() 再根据参数更新，两者之间存在时间窗口。在此期间，攻击者可通过并发执行 fallocate 系统调用触发 f2fs_drop_extent_tree() 访问已释放的 extent cache 锁，导致空指针解引用，引发内核崩溃。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核使用 F2FS 文件系统的版本，本地普通用户可利用此漏洞发起拒绝服务攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53447"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T16:15:49Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:21Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.10.210、5.15.149、6.1.64、6.6.3 及以上包含 commit 3c6b5b1c2b8e 的版本，或应用对应稳定分支的补丁。临时缓解措施：避免在 f2fs 文件系统上并发执行 remount 与 fallocate 操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/115557cc226a927924f2d7d1980ccbf6e3b3bb36","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/458c15dfbce62c35fefd9ca637b20a051309c9f1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53447.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53447.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53447.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53447","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53447.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53447.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/16/seguranca/cve-2023-53447-f2fs-dont-reset-unchangable-mount-o-1765935541000.md","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53447","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53447.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2023-53447"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0401.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0400","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53438","title":"Linux 内核 AMD Zen 处理器 IF Poison 错误处理不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 x86/MCE 子系统中存在逻辑缺陷，AMD Zen 系列处理器在指令获取（IF）单元发生毒化错误时，微架构无法保证同步 #MC 异常传递，导致 MCG_STATUS[EIPV|RIPV] 标志位不被设置。内核因未正确保存代码段（CS）寄存器值，默认将错误上下文判定为内核态（cs=0），从而触发非必要的内核恐慌（kernel panic），造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 AMD Zen 架构的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，本地攻击者可通过触发数据毒化错误利用此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53438"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T16:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:20Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.53、6.4.16、6.5.3 或 6.6 及以上版本，对应内核稳定分支补丁提交分别为 4240e2ebe679、6eac39659014、2e01bdf7203c 和 e6e6a5f50f58。受影响系统请优先更新内核包（apt upgrade linux-image 或 yum update kernel）并重启。临时缓解可在 grub 内核启动参数添加 mce=off 禁用 MCE 处理，但此举会关闭所有机器检查异常上报，仅作为紧急临时方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2e01bdf7203c383e9d8489d9f963c52d6c81e4db","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4240e2ebe67941ce2c4f5c866c3af4b5ac7a0c67","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6eac3965901489ae114a664a78cd2d1415d1af5c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e6e6a5f50f58fadec397b23064b7e4830292863d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53438.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53438.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53438.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53438","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53438.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53438.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-wqhj-q653-q9c9/GHSA-wqhj-q653-q9c9.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53438","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53438.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71924.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0398","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0398.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53424","title":"Linux Kernel MediaTek 时钟驱动内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MediaTek 时钟驱动（clk-mtk.c）中存在内存泄漏漏洞。当 mtk_clk_simple_probe() 函数在执行过程中检测到 clk_data 不存在等错误条件时，未能释放先前通过 of_iomap() 映射的 I/O 内存（base），导致内核内存泄漏。本地攻击者可反复触发驱动探测错误路径，逐步耗尽系统内存资源，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响使用 MediaTek 芯片组且运行受影响 Linux 内核版本的设备，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53424"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T16:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:17Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.5 及以上版本，或对应长期支持分支：6.1.x 升级至 6.1.164+，6.3.x 升级至 6.3.13+，6.4.x 升级至 6.4.4+。无法立即升级时，可应用内核稳定分支补丁（commit 847d5dd788ce、3db7285e0441、47234e19b008、2cae6a28d8c1），在 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mtk.c 的 mtk_clk_simple_probe() 错误处理路径中加入 free_base 释放 of_iomap 映射内存。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2cae6a28d8c12c597e8656962271520434c61c48","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3db7285e044144fd88a356f5b641b9cd4b231a77","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/47234e19b00816a8a7b278c7173f6d4e928c43c7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/847d5dd788ce05f0aaaa36ea174f7f0b9cf86f7d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53424.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53424.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53424.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53424","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53424.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53424.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-hp7p-hw7m-prxm/GHSA-hp7p-hw7m-prxm.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53424","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53424.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71918.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0398.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0397","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0397.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53421","title":"Linux Kernel blk-cgroup 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 blk-cgroup 子系统的 blkcg_reset_stats() 函数在清空 blkg_iostat_set 结构体后未正确重新初始化 blkg 和 sync 字段，导致空指针解引用，可能引发内核崩溃（panic）。该漏洞源于 commit 3b8cc6298724 和 f73316482977 引入的字段在重置时未同步重建，攻击者需具备 cgroup v1 操作权限才能触发。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等，影响使用相关内核版本的 Linux 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53421"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T16:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:45:17Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 6.4.4、6.3.13、6.1.162、5.15.199 或 5.10.258 及以上版本，其中已包含对 blkcg_reset_stats() 中 blkg_iostat_set 未正确重新初始化导致空指针解引用的修复补丁。如无法立即升级，可通过内核 livepatch 机制加载热补丁（KPatch/KGraft）临时缓解，或限制普通用户对 cgroup v1 blkio 控制器的写入权限以降低触发风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0561aa6033dd181594116d705c41fc16e97161a2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d2af77e31ade05ff7ccc3658c3635ec1bea0979","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/58c135513562698f222a58ba07dbdfcfb268aa0d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/892faa76be894d324bf48b12a55c7af7be2bad83","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/abbce7f82613ea5eeefd0fc3c1c8e449b9cef2a2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b0d26283af612b9e0cc3188b0b88ad7fdea447e8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53421.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53421.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53421","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53421.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53421.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53421.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-63xc-pmjj-q4vj/GHSA-63xc-pmjj-q4vj.json","https://github.com/ctrliq/advisories/blob/b05bfbc3a1de170377430c48777435c2cc639f64/csaf/vex/cve/2023/cve-2023-53421.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be2